        "jsCode": "const product = $json.product_name;\nconst variant = $json.variant_title;\nconst sku = $json.sku || \"N/A\";\nconst stock = $json.available_stock;\nconst location = $json.location_name;\nconst action = $json.action;\n\nconst checkedAt = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(\"en-GB\", {\n  timeZone: \"Asia/Karachi\",\n  day: \"2-digit\",\n  month: \"short\",\n  year: \"numeric\",\n  hour: \"2-digit\",\n  minute: \"2-digit\",\n  hour12: true\n}).format(new Date());\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...$json,\n\n    checked_at: checkedAt,\n\n    alert_sent: true,\n    alert_type: \"Critical\",\n\n    slack_message:\n`ðŸš¨ *CRITICAL INVENTORY ALERT*\n\n*Product:* ${product}\n*Variant:* ${variant}\n*SKU:* ${sku}\n*Location:* ${location}\n\n*Available Stock:* ${stock}\n*Status:* ${$json.inventory_status}\n*Urgency:* ${$json.urgency}\n\n*Action:* ${action}\n\nâš ï¸ Immediate attention required.`\n  }\n};"
